<title>USA: Citicorp Q4 net, shr, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Q4 net, shr, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>NERW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.97		    $1.89</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.97		    $1.72</p>
<p> Net			987,000		  905,000</p>
<p> Adjusted Revs	5,747,000		5,047,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     480,900		  505,700</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $7.50		    $7.21</p>
<p> Shr diluted     $7.42		    $6.48</p>
<p> Net		 3,788,000		3,464,000</p>
<p> Adjusted Revs   21,542,000	     19,618,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted490,000		  511,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call earnings estimates were $1.95 per share for 1996 Q4 and $7.47 per share for full year.  </p>
<p>Excluding $64 million pretax Savings Association Insurance Fund assessment, and $55 million pretax charge for performance-based options, 1996 full year earnings were $7.57 per share.</p>
</text>
